        "original_id": "8646c428-f2e4-5df9-bda0-5bb7d844c1c2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aamir Khan, Nasir Hussain, Salim Khan, Javed Akhtar, Dharmendra, Zeenat Aman, Ajit Khan, Vijay Arora, Tariq Khan, Neetu Singh, Tahir Hussain\n- Works: Yaadon Ki Baaraat\n- Roles: actor, director, producer, writer, child actor\n- Awards: National Film Awards, Filmfare Awards, Academy Award\n\nFacts:\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat is a 1973 Indian Hindi film directed by Nasir Hussain and written by Salim-Javed, the duo of Salim Khan and Javed Akhtar.\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat starred Dharmendra, Zeenat Aman, Ajit Khan, Vijay Arora, Tariq Khan, Neetu Singh, and Aamir Khan.\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat was the debut film of Tariq Khan, who is Nasir Hussain's nephew.\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat was also the debut film of Aamir Khan, who appeared as a child actor and is the son of Tahir Hussain, Nasir Hussain's brother.\n- Aamir Khan was born as Mohammed Aamir Hussain Khan on 14 March 1965.\n- Aamir Khan is an Indian film actor, director, and producer.\n- Aamir Khan has received four National Film Awards, eight Filmfare Awards, and an Academy Award nomination.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "4f8c180d-eced-5e6e-a156-ea20ba672041",
        "text": "Page: Yaadon Ki Baaraat. Sentence: Yaadon Ki Baaraat (English: \"Procession of Memories\") is a 1973 Indian Hindi film, directed by Nasir Hussain and written by Salim-Javed (Salim Khan and Javed Akhtar).\nPage: Yaadon Ki Baaraat. Sentence: It starred Dharmendra, Zeenat Aman, Ajit Khan, Vijay Arora, Tariq Khan, Neetu Singh and Aamir Khan.\nPage: Yaadon Ki Baaraat. Sentence: It was also the debut film for Tariq Khan (Nasir Hussain's nephew), as well as Aamir Khan (Tahir Hussain's, brother of Nasir Hussain, son), a child actor in this film and later one of India's biggest movie stars as an adult.\nPage: Aamir Khan. Sentence: Aamir Khan (] ; born Mohammed Aamir Hussain Khan on 14 March 1965) is an Indian film actor, director, and producer.\nPage: Aamir Khan. Sentence: He is the recipient of numerous awards, including four National Film Awards and eight Filmfare Awards, as well as an Academy Award nomination.",
